* text eol=lf
# Images are bytes. The line above forces every file under build/ to text, and it rewrites the CR/LF
# bytes inside a committed picture: a clean clone then carries a broken image, and a byte-for-byte
# check against that copy cannot notice, because both sides are broken the same way. This file
# overrides the root .gitattributes for build/.
*.tiff binary
*.tif binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
